    },
    "message": "Renamed to VpnHood.AppHosting.Desktop, with no change in what it holds: VpnHood's app packages are named by layer (AppLib is AppLogic, AppUi.Hosting is AppHosting, and the look is AppUi.Avalonia.Classic). This id receives no further updates.",
    "reasons": [
      "Legacy"
    ]
  },
  "description": "The VpnHood desktop window: the window over a running app's own API, one per person and session, and the host that runs the app and its window in one process. Platform-free - the service and its commands are VpnHood.AppUi.Hosting.Desktop.Daemon's, and where an install keeps things is the platform package's to say (Desktop.Linux, Desktop.WindowsTun, Desktop.WindowsVpnPlugin)",
